WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:05.630
Why isn't he picking up right now?

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:07.340
What happened?

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:10.135
-Kotona's in danger.
-Danger how?

00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:13.138
I don't know,
but some weirdo&nbsp;is following her.

00:00:13.513 --> 00:00:15.140
-Just hurry.
-Okay.

00:00:18.727 --> 00:00:20.478
-Drop me off here.
-Sure!

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.694
Will you try contacting Haru?

00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:31.072
Sure. I'll try looking for her too.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:46.046
Kotona!

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.219
Stop it!

00:01:12.113 --> 00:01:13.031
Kotona?

00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:15.950
Kotona!

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.036
Kotona...

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.455
Don't worry, you're fine.

00:01:29.714 --> 00:01:31.257
We'll call an ambulance.

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:38.640
What happened?

00:01:41.226 --> 00:01:43.269
Haru, she was stabbed by someone.

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:45.146
Kotona!

00:01:46.564 --> 00:01:49.776
Haru, you shouldn't move her!
Let's call an ambulance!

00:01:49.901 --> 00:01:53.238
Shut up!&nbsp;Be quiet! What were you doing?

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.950
-I...
-I'm taking her to the hospital.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:58.118
Haru!

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.084
Dammit!

00:02:07.085 --> 00:02:08.169
Haru, don't!

00:02:11.422 --> 00:02:12.257
Haru!

00:02:30.608 --> 00:02:32.443
Where the heck are we?

00:02:32.777 --> 00:02:36.114
-And what's up with this outfit?
-Yeah.

00:02:37.031 --> 00:02:39.367
-Kotona's gone!
-That's right. Kotona!

00:02:39.534 --> 00:02:40.785
Where's Kotona?

00:02:48.209 --> 00:02:49.627
Haru, your phone!

00:02:49.794 --> 00:02:50.628
Right!

00:02:56.217 --> 00:02:57.385
This is...

00:02:58.720 --> 00:02:59.804
a compass.

00:03:02.557 --> 00:03:03.808
What's going on?

